    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You fill the air with weapon fire, keeping your opponents from escaping the barrage.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you make an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a> with a weapon set on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Autofire\" title=\"Autofire\">Autofire</a>, and you are proficient with that weapon, all targets in the area lose all dodge or deflection bonuses to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> against the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Autofire\" title=\"Autofire\">Autofire</a> attack.</p>",
